            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual manipulador corresponde à falha de <code>int(\"none\")</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except ValueError:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except TypeError:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ZeroDivisionError:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except ValueError:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual manipulador corresponde à falha de <code>int(\"none\")</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except ValueError:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except TypeError:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ZeroDivisionError:</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Tanto <code>except ValueError:</code> quanto <code>except TypeError:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>except ValueError:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Complete the Value Handler",
            "id": 152092,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o manipulador para texto que não pode ser convertido em um número inteiro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"entry.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entry = \" /><text value=\"&quot;none&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  amount = int(entry)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter a number&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Enter a number\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o manipulador para texto que não pode ser convertido em um número inteiro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"entry.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entry = \" /><text value=\"&quot;none&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  amount = int(entry)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter a number&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"str\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Enter a number\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>int</code> seguido de <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
