          {
            "title": "Keep Specific Handlers First",
            "id": 152095,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é verdade sobre este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other failure&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele mantém a resposta personalizada acessível e o fallback por último</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele mantém a resposta personalizada acessível e adiciona primeiro a alternativa de fallback</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele mantém a resposta personalizada acessível e não tem fallback</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele mantém a resposta personalizada acessível e o fallback por último.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esses manipuladores vêm após um bloco <code>try</code>. Se ele gerar <code>ValueError</code>, quais mensagens serão exibidas?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other failure&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Somente Invalid value.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Somente Other failure.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Invalid value e depois Other failure.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nenhuma mensagem, pois um manipulador sem tipo não pode vir após um manipulador específico.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Somente Invalid value.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch Missing Data",
            "id": 152096,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o segundo manipulador para a chave <code>\"role\"</code> ausente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  role = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing field&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Missing field\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>KeyError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tente ler o campo ausente e trate o erro de chave ausente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  role = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing field&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Missing field\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"role\"</code> seguido de <code>KeyError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
