            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual handler captura os detalhes da conversão e identifica a importação que falhou?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except ValueError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ValueError: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except: print(\"Import failed\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except ValueError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma importação usa <code>float(\"free\")</code>. Qual handler exibe os detalhes e deixa erros de chave ausente sem tratamento?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">except ValueError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">except ValueError: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">except KeyError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">except Exception as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">except ValueError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error).</p></body></html>",
